-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a logic on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\cup\\{&lt;\\}\">\\(\\sigma\\cup\\{&lt;\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\">\\(\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}order\\text{-}independent}\\vdash\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{OI}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\;\\forall &lt;_1,&lt;_2\\in\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)\\;\\bigl(\\mathfrak O_\\sigma((A,&lt;_1))\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak O_\\sigma((A,&lt;_2))\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}order\\text{-}independent}\\vdash\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{OI}_{\\mathcal L}[\\sigma]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A